	<row id="msg_0549_T20R0402_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ain’t it crazy how rollin’\nwith homies make the block\fhit different?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nSlide through different spots and\ftalk to your homies!\rYou gon’ learn so much about\n’em. Real recognize real!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0549_T20R0402_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ain’t it crazy how rollin’\nwith homies make the block\fhit different?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nSlide through different spots and\ftalk to your homies!\rYou gon’ learn so much about\n’em. Real recognize real!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0549_T20R0402_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Aye pimp, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nHow your homies doin’?\fDon’t forget to talk to...\rWait, what’s that?\nYour homie holdin’ a leaf...\rIs that a Shiny Leaf?\nWord is only homies\fthat really ride for\fyou can find them...\rBack in the day, people turned\n’em into a crown when they\fcollected five.\rSheesh!\nI knew you had it in you,\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fShow me when you get another!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0549_T20R0402_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nHow your homies doin’?\fDon’t forget to talk to...\rWait, what’s that?\nYour homie holdin’ a leaf...\rIs that a Shiny Leaf?\nWord is only homies\fthat really ride for\fyou can find them...\rBack in the day, people turned\n’em into a crown when they\fcollected five.\rSheesh!\nI knew you had it in you,\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fShow me when you get another!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0549_T20R0402_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Aye pimp, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nHow the homie you\fwalkin’ with?\rTalk to it while y’all walk\nsometimes. Build that loyalty!\r...\nOh!\rYou found a Shiny Leaf!\nLemme see!\rHa! You got...\r{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0}!\rThat’s what’s up!\nKeep goin’, get {STRVAR_1 50, 2, 0} more!</language>
	</row>
